message: "If you use FluxMMM in research or industry work, please cite the software and working paper."
title: "FluxMMM: An Open-Source, Evidence-Gated Bayesian Workflow for Marketing Mix Modeling and Budget Decisions"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bramao
    given-names: Gustavo
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-05
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/gustavobramao/fluxmmm"
url: "https://fluxmmm-web.web.app/"
abstract: >-
  A local-first marketing mix modeling workflow connecting data validation,
  evidence calibration, bounded specification search, four-layer validation,
  production posterior sampling, and uncertainty-aware budget decisions.
keywords:
  - marketing mix modeling
  - Bayesian calibration
  - causal inference
  - posterior sampling
  - media optimization
